            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "第三单元"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                107,
                67,
                327,
                109
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "优美的古诗词是中华传统文化的瑰宝，蕴含着中华儿女代代相传的文化基因。阅读古诗词作品，可以体味古人丰富的情感、深邃的思想、多样的人生，加深对社会的思考，增强对人生的感悟，激发对中华优秀传统文化的热爱之情。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                378,
                271,
                904,
                407
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "本单元汇集了不同时期、不同体式的诗词名作。曹操对“天下归心”的渴望，陶渊明“复得返自然”的淡泊，展示了两种不同的人生状态；李白驰骋想象的豪迈，杜甫登高望远的悲凉，白居易“同是天涯沦落人”的慨叹，表现出各自的人生境遇和情感世界；苏轼、辛弃疾词的豪放，李清照词的婉约，则展示出宋词不同的审美追求。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                378,
                413,
                904,
                607
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "学习本单元，要逐步掌握古诗词鉴赏的基本方法，认识古诗词的当代价值，增强对中华优秀传统文化的传承意识。要在诵读和想象中感受诗歌的意境，欣赏其独特的艺术魅力；感受诗人的精神世界，体会诗人对社会的思考与对人生的感悟，提高自身的思想修养和文化品位；尝试写作文学短评。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                378,
                614,
                904,
                780
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "短歌行"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                425,
                96,
                559,
                129
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "曹 操"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                458,
                149,
                527,
                172
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "content": {
                "list_type": "text_list",
                "attribute": "unordered",
                "list_items": [
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "对酒当歌<sup>b</sup>，人生几何<sup>c</sup> ！譬如朝露，去日苦多<sup>d</sup>。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "慨当以慷<sup>e</sup>，忧思难忘。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "何以解忧？唯有杜康 <sup>f</sup>。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "青青子衿，悠悠我心<sup>g</sup>。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "但为君故，沉吟<sup>h</sup> 至今。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "呦呦鹿鸣，食野之苹。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "我有嘉宾，鼓瑟吹笙<sup>i</sup>。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "明明如月，何时可掇<sup>j</sup> ？忧从中来，不可断绝。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "越陌度阡 <sup>k</sup>，枉用相存 <sup>l</sup>。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "契阔谈讌 <sup>m</sup>，心念旧恩。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "月明星稀，乌鹊南飞。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "绕树三匝 <sup>n</sup>，何枝可依？山不厌高，海不厌深<sup>o</sup>。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "周公吐哺 <sup>p</sup>，天下归心。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                371,
                198,
                613,
                596
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "a 选自《曹操集·诗集》（中华书局2013年版）。诗的题目是汉乐府旧题。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                612,
                467,
                646
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "客的诗，这里用来表达招纳贤才的热情。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                541,
                612,
                818,
                629
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "j〔掇〕拾取，摘取。一说同“辍”，停止。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                630,
                821,
                648
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "k〔越陌度阡〕穿过纵横交错的小路。陌，东西向的田间小路。阡，南北向的田间小路。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                648,
                892,
                682
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "l〔枉用相存〕屈驾来访。枉，这里是枉驾的意思。用，以。存，问候、探望。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                683,
                889,
                718
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "m〔契阔谈讌（yàn）〕久别重逢，欢饮畅谈。契阔，聚散，这里指久别重逢。讌，同“宴”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                719,
                889,
                753
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "n〔三匝（zā）〕三周。匝，周、圈。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                755,
                778,
                771
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "o〔山不厌高，海不厌深〕这里是仿用《管子·形势解》中的话：“海不辞水，故能成其大；山不辞土石，故能成其高；明主不厌人，故能成其众。”意思是表示希望尽可能多地接纳人才。厌，满足。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                772,
                892,
                843
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "p〔周公吐哺（bǔ）〕《史记·鲁周公世家》记载，周公广纳贤才，正吃饭时，听到门外有士子求见，来不及咽下嘴里的食物，把食物一吐就赶紧去接见。这里借用这个典故，表示自己像周公一样热切殷勤地接待贤才。吐哺，吐出嘴里的食物。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                519,
                844,
                892,
                933
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "d〔去日苦多〕可悲的是逝去的日子太多了。这是慨叹人生短暂。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                701,
                467,
                736
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "b〔对酒当歌〕面对着酒与歌，即饮酒听歌。当，也是“对”的意思。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                648,
                468,
                682
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "e〔慨当以慷〕即“慷慨”。这里指宴会上的歌声激越不平。当以，没有实义。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                737,
                467,
                771
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "f〔杜康〕相传是最早造酒的人。这里代指酒。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                772,
                418,
                790
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "g〔青青子衿（jīn），悠悠我心〕语出《诗经·郑风·子衿》，原写姑娘思念情人，这里用来比喻渴望得到贤才。子，对对方的尊称。青衿，指代周代读书人青色交领的服装。衿，衣服的交领。悠悠，长远的样子，形容思虑连绵不断。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                791,
                467,
                878
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "h〔沉吟〕沉思吟味。这里指思念和倾慕贤人。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                879,
                418,
                897
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "i〔呦呦鹿鸣，食野之苹。我有嘉宾，鼓瑟吹笙〕语出《诗经·小雅·鹿鸣》。苹，艾蒿。《鹿鸣》是宴"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                94,
                897,
                468,
                933
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
                "page_number_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "58"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                95,
                940,
                122,
                954
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footer",
            "content": {
                "page_footer_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "语文 必修上册"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                134,
                938,
                248,
                954
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "归园田居（其一）"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 1
            },
            "bbox": [
                363,
                64,
                650,
                95
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "陶渊明"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                472,
                117,
                537,
                136
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "少无适俗<sup>b</sup> 韵<sup>c</sup>，性本爱丘山<sup>d</sup>。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                190,
                630,
                212
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "误落尘网<sup>e</sup> 中，一去三十年<sup>f</sup>。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                216,
                616,
                237
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "羁鸟<sup>g</sup> 恋旧林，池鱼思故渊。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                241,
                598,
                262
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "开荒南野<sup>h</sup> 际，守拙<sup>i</sup> 归园田。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                266,
                613,
                287
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "方宅十余亩 <sup>j</sup>，草屋八九间。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                291,
                594,
                312
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "榆柳荫后檐，桃李罗堂前。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                317,
                579,
                337
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "暧暧<sup>k</sup> 远人村，依依<sup>l</sup> 墟里<sup>m</sup> 烟。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                341,
                630,
                361
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "狗吠深巷中，鸡鸣桑树颠<sup>n</sup>。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                366,
                594,
                387
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "户庭<sup>o</sup> 无尘杂<sup>p</sup>，虚室<sup>q</sup> 有余闲<sup>r</sup>。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                391,
                642,
                412
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "久在樊笼 <sup>s</sup> 里，复得返自然。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                337,
                416,
                594,
                437
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/c5aba89abd1d83ace1db3df1de523082fdf2d78b270f4f5658f5d4f188569765.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                131,
                474,
                173,
                505
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "学习提示"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                188,
                480,
                292,
                502
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "曹操的《短歌行》表达对时光流逝的感慨，以及建功立业的宏愿。陶渊明的《归园田居》抒发对官场生活的厌倦，以及辞官归隐、躬耕田园的自由、喜悦之情。这两首诗均为古体诗，但在语言风格和表达技巧上有很大不同。前者是四言，质朴刚健，运用比兴手法，化用典故或引前人诗句表达心志；后者是五言，平淡舒缓，善用白描，寥寥数笔就勾勒出一幅乡村日常生活的图景。要在诵读中体会两首诗不同的韵律、节奏和表达技巧，结合诗人的身世领悟诗中的思想感情。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                517,
                862,
                664
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "背诵《短歌行》。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                186,
                667,
                341,
                687
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "i〔守拙〕持守愚拙的本性，即不学巧伪，不争名利。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                719,
                899,
                738
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "j〔方宅十余亩〕宅子四周有十几亩地。方，四周围绕。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                738,
                897,
                756
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "k〔暧（ài）暧〕迷蒙隐约的样子。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                756,
                778,
                774
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "l〔依依〕隐约的样子。一说“轻柔的样子”。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                529,
                774,
                852,
